KardboardCode Desktop Studio
Status: IN_PROGRESS
Milestone: Native desktop GUI, with CLI compatibility and documented calibration
Dependencies: Existing Python/OpenCV/MediaPipe/ModernGL application
Purpose: Make every existing operating mode accessible without memorizing CLI commands.

Workstreams:
  01_RESEARCH_AND_DESIGN.todo
  02_RUNTIME_AND_CALIBRATION.todo
  03_NATIVE_INTERFACE.todo
  04_DOCUMENTATION_AND_DELIVERY.todo
  05_DEVELOPMENT_LEDGER.todo

Tasks:
  [x] Confirm scope with the user: expose all features, including experimental modes.
  [x] Include the user's follow-up requirement: a tutorial.
  [ ] Complete the four delivery workstreams in dependency order.

Acceptance criteria:
  Every CLI option has an identified GUI control.
  Recording and model setup have usable graphical actions.
  Live left/right eye thresholds affect both expressions and action detection.
  No camera starts automatically; raw modes require explicit acknowledgement.
  Completed evidence is separate from user approval.

Completion evidence:
